{
  "name": "Sales Pipeline Report",
  "description": "Reads a CRM export, calculates deal stage conversion rates and weighted revenue by sales rep, filters active deals, and produces a ranked performance summary.",
  "category": "sales",
  "tags": [
    "sales",
    "crm",
    "pipeline",
    "revenue",
    "conversion",
    "reporting"
  ],
  "difficulty": "beginner",
  "containers": [
    {
      "id": "ctr_sp1",
      "title": "Step 1 - Ingest & Normalize CRM Data",
      "x": 60,
      "y": 60,
      "width": 840,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "rgba(59,130,246,0.07)",
      "headerColor": "#3b82f6",
      "collapsed": false,
      "disabled": false
    },
    {
      "id": "ctr_sp2",
      "title": "Step 2 - Summarize & Rank by Rep",
      "x": 950,
      "y": 60,
      "width": 780,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "rgba(34,197,94,0.07)",
      "headerColor": "#16a34a",
      "collapsed": false,
      "disabled": false
    }
  ],
  "comments": [
    {
      "id": "comment_sp1",
      "text": "### Sales Pipeline Report\n- **Input CSV**: Expects columns: DealID, SalesRep, Stage, DealValue, CloseDate, IsWon\n- **Formula**: Computes WeightedRevenue based on stage probability\n- **Filter**: Only active or won deals (excludes Lost/Cancelled)\n- **Summarize**: Groups by SalesRep, sums DealValue and counts wins\n- **Multi-Row Formula**: Running cumulative revenue across reps",
      "x": 60,
      "y": 380,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 160,
      "color": "#3b82f6"
    }
  ],
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "node_sp_in",
      "type": "input_data",
      "name": "Input CRM Pipeline (CSV)",
      "x": 100,
      "y": 170,
      "config": {
        "file_path": "crm_pipeline.csv",
        "file_type": "csv",
        "delimiter": ",",
        "has_header": true
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "node_sp_af",
      "type": "auto_field",
      "name": "Auto Field Types",
      "x": 280,
      "y": 170,
      "config": {
        "fields": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "node_sp_clean",
      "type": "clean",
      "name": "Normalize Stage Names",
      "x": 460,
      "y": 170,
      "config": {
        "columns": [
          "Stage",
          "SalesRep"
        ],
        "trim_whitespace": true,
        "case_transformation": "title",
        "remove_empty_rows": true
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "node_sp_formula",
      "type": "formula",
      "name": "Calculate Weighted Revenue",
      "x": 660,
      "y": 170,
      "config": {
        "formulas": [
          {
            "output_field": "StageProbability",
            "type": "float",
            "expression": "IF([Stage] = \"Won\", 1.0, IF([Stage] = \"Proposal\", 0.7, IF([Stage] = \"Qualified\", 0.4, IF([Stage] = \"Discovery\", 0.2, 0.05))))"
          },
          {
            "output_field": "WeightedRevenue",
            "type": "float",
            "expression": "[DealValue] * [StageProbability]"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "node_sp_filter",
      "type": "filter",
      "name": "Exclude Lost Deals",
      "x": 990,
      "y": 170,
      "config": {
        "mode": "basic",
        "logical_op": "AND",
        "conditions": [
          {
            "column": "Stage",
            "operator": "!=",
            "value": "Lost"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "node_sp_sum",
      "type": "summarize",
      "name": "Summarize by Sales Rep",
      "x": 1190,
      "y": 130,
      "config": {
        "actions": [
          {
            "field": "SalesRep",
            "action": "GroupBy",
            "output_name": "SalesRep"
          },
          {
            "field": "DealValue",
            "action": "Sum",
            "output_name": "TotalPipelineValue"
          },
          {
            "field": "WeightedRevenue",
            "action": "Sum",
            "output_name": "WeightedPipelineValue"
          },
          {
            "field": "DealID",
            "action": "Count",
            "output_name": "TotalDeals"
          },
          {
            "field": "IsWon",
            "action": "Sum",
            "output_name": "ClosedWonCount"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "node_sp_sort",
      "type": "sort",
      "name": "Sort by Weighted Revenue",
      "x": 1410,
      "y": 130,
      "config": {
        "sort_by": [
          {
            "column": "WeightedPipelineValue",
            "ascending": false
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "node_sp_cumulative",
      "type": "multi_row_formula",
      "name": "Running Cumulative Revenue",
      "x": 1590,
      "y": 130,
      "config": {
        "output_field": "CumulativeRevenue",
        "is_new_field": true,
        "output_type": "float",
        "values_for_rows_not_exist": "0",
        "group_by_fields": [],
        "expression": "[Row-1:CumulativeRevenue] + [WeightedPipelineValue]"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "node_sp_out",
      "type": "output_data",
      "name": "Export Pipeline Report",
      "x": 1780,
      "y": 130,
      "config": {
        "filename": "sales_pipeline_report",
        "format": "xlsx",
        "write_mode": "overwrite"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "node_sp_browse",
      "type": "browse",
      "name": "Preview Ranked Reps",
      "x": 1780,
      "y": 260,
      "config": {}
    }
  ],
  "connections": [
    {
      "id": "csp1",
      "source": "node_sp_in",
      "sourceHandle": "O",
      "target": "node_sp_af",
      "targetHandle": "I"
    },
    {
      "id": "csp2",
      "source": "node_sp_af",
      "sourceHandle": "O",
      "target": "node_sp_clean",
      "targetHandle": "I"
    },
    {
      "id": "csp3",
      "source": "node_sp_clean",
      "sourceHandle": "O",
      "target": "node_sp_formula",
      "targetHandle": "I"
    },
    {
      "id": "csp4",
      "source": "node_sp_formula",
      "sourceHandle": "O",
      "target": "node_sp_filter",
      "targetHandle": "I"
    },
    {
      "id": "csp5",
      "source": "node_sp_filter",
      "sourceHandle": "T",
      "target": "node_sp_sum",
      "targetHandle": "I"
    },
    {
      "id": "csp6",
      "source": "node_sp_sum",
      "sourceHandle": "O",
      "target": "node_sp_sort",
      "targetHandle": "I"
    },
    {
      "id": "csp7",
      "source": "node_sp_sort",
      "sourceHandle": "O",
      "target": "node_sp_cumulative",
      "targetHandle": "I"
    },
    {
      "id": "csp8",
      "source": "node_sp_cumulative",
      "sourceHandle": "O",
      "target": "node_sp_out",
      "targetHandle": "I"
    },
    {
      "id": "csp9",
      "source": "node_sp_cumulative",
      "sourceHandle": "O",
      "target": "node_sp_browse",
      "targetHandle": "I"
    }
  ]
}